      "bytes": 1062606,
      "level": "Recommended",
      "intent": "Retain the existing inline source and preview arrangement. Add a compact header 'Equation' and labels Source and Preview; show a clear inline warning 'Unknown command' linked to the visible unsupported command in the source. Keep the authored TeX unchanged and add short existing keyboard guidance 'Shift+Enter to return to text'. Pins: 1 source and preview are distinguished; 2 plain error explains the red command; 3 exit guidance reduces mode uncertainty. Render a simple a+b over c expression, and show unsupported command as an error, not corrected silently.",
      "annotations": [
        "Source and preview are distinguished",
        "Plain error explains the red command",
        "Exit guidance reduces mode uncertainty"
      ]
    }
